.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH ARACNE 1 2000-1月 "read_prior" "read_prior"
.SH NAME
read_prior \- Load the curated \fBTF -> target\fR prior network from a csv table.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIread_prior(\fBfile\fR as string, 
\fBmin_confidence\fR as double = 0.45, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Load the curated \fBTF -> target\fR prior network from a csv table.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the curated prior table, the header must contain the \fBTF\fR and
 the \fBTargetGene\fR columns; the optional \fBConfidence\fR column (\fBHigh\fR/
 \fBMedium\fR/\fBLow\fR or a numeric value) and the optional \fBRegulationType\fR column
 (\fBActivator\fR/\fBInhibitor\fR) are recognized as well.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmin_confidence\fB \fR\- the eligibility threshold of the prior confidence, default 0.45. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [RegulatoryEdge](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.BioSystem.Core.RegulatoryEdge) vector that can be passed to the \fBprior\fR argument of \fBaracne\fR
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
let prior = ARACNE::read_prior("G:/vcc2026/data/TF_target_prior_curated.csv", min_confidence = 0.9);
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ARACNE
.SH FILES
.PP
TRNtoolkit.dll
.PP
